# Demo requests. In VS Code, click "Send Request" above each one (C# Dev Kit or REST Client extension).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5041

### List vendors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendors

### Q3 funding for Sunshine Citrus Co. (the demo endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendors/1/funding-summary?period=2026-Q3

### Same vendor, one month
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendors/1/funding-summary?period=2026-08

### Deals for a vendor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendors/2/deals

### Create a vendor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vendors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorNumber": "V1004",
  "name": "Lakeland Bakery Supply"
}

### Create a scan-down deal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vendors/1/deals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealNumber": "D-24030",
  "description": "Holiday OJ feature",
  "type": "ScanDown",
  "startDate": "2026-11-15",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31",
  "sku": "100245",
  "ratePerUnit": 0.35
}

### Validation errors (end before start, missing rate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vendors/1/deals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealNumber": "D-BAD",
  "description": "Broken deal",
  "type": "ScanDown",
  "startDate": "2026-12-31",
  "endDate": "2026-11-01",
  "sku": "100245"
}

### Import sales
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "storeNumber": "S0001", "sku": "100245", "saleDate": "2026-11-16", "unitsSold": 42, "netSales": 209.58 }
]

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
